<metadata preset-name="Dive Bomb Weld" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A fat saw lead doubles every note and chord into a boosted British master-volume head with the guitar, and a polyphonic whammy after the cab lets the Dive macro drop the fused voice two octaves as one. Poly tracking: lines or chords; the synth steps by semitone under bends, the whammy dives the lot." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
