<headroom-library version="1" id="gm-dive-bomb-weld" category="Guitar + MIDI" order="100" instrument="guitar" style="Hybrid Shred">
  <description>A fat saw lead doubles every note and chord into a boosted British master-volume head with the guitar, and a polyphonic whammy after the cab lets the Dive macro drop the fused voice two octaves as one. Poly tracking: lines or chords; the synth steps by semitone under bends, the whammy dives the lot.</description>
  <tags><tag>Guitar + MIDI</tag><tag>Fused</tag><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Whammy</tag><tag>Synth</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Poly</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://guitargearfinder.com/guides/tom-morello-guitar-gear-rig-rage-against-the-machine/" title="Guitar Gear Finder: Tom Morello's Rage Against the Machine rig"/>
    <source url="https://www.premierguitar.com/videos/rig-rundown/muse" title="Premier Guitar: Rig Rundown, Muse (Kaoss Pad synth textures blended with the guitar)"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
